From 92f6d2415e315224ea6636f50d6d863d3f18c296 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 07:25:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prose profile: NetSurf, the web browser

NetSurf 3.11 with its Be API front end, built by prosepkg with its
libraries (libcss, libdom, hubbub, libparserutils, libwapcaplet, libnsbmp,
libnsgif, libnslog, libnspsl, libnsutils, libsvgtiny, libutf8proc), curl
and OpenSSL. JavaScript is in (duktape; the bindings generated by an
nsgenbind built for the Mac).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0044-prose-profile-netsurf-the-web-browser.patch 438ff0ce2d46c2eec2c7db063ec86261426a2b179825bb13d8da522f8e34a9dd
